{searchable}

1. {#search-dir-root; open} Search dir fixture SEARCHABLE_DIR_TEXT
  1. {#search-dir-child} SEARCHABLE_DIR_NEEDLE inherited from directory meta
  2. {#search-dir-collapsed} Collapsed parent inside a searchable file
    1. {#search-dir-deep} SEARCHABLE_DIR_DEEP_TEXT, unmounted until expanded
